    "task": "text-classification",
    "description": "A compact RuBERT model for multilabel toxicity and inappropriateness classification of short informal Russian text, converted by ONNX Community for browser inference with Transformers.js.",
    "intendedUses": [
      "Screen short Russian comments for toxicity signals.",
      "Inspect insult, obscenity, threat, and reputational-danger scores.",
      "Benchmark local browser text classification across ONNX variants."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Designed for short informal Russian text; other languages, long documents, dialects, coded language, and domain-specific usage may be unreliable.",
      "Scores can encode dataset bias and can produce both false positives and false negatives.",
      "The dangerous label concerns potential reputational harm and is not interchangeable with toxicity.",
      "Automated scores require human review before moderation or other consequential decisions.",
      "The model does not understand speaker intent or broader conversational context."
    ]
  },
